                "text": "12 years ago, the Affordable Care Act changed healthcare as we knew it. \n\nSince then, millions of Americans have gained coverage and millions more have seen lower premiums and Rx costs.\n\nHealthcare is a human right, and the ACA will always be my proudest vote. #ACAIsHereToStay https://t.co/l7ZG8STr8a",
