                "text": "In the third year of a global pandemic, our collective mental health is in crisis. \n\nThank you to the healthcare providers working around the clock to support our children.  \n\nI will always fight for the resources needed to care for Rhode Islanders. \n\nhttps://t.co/xOR7AMsbs9",
