                "text": "As SCOTUS prepares to decide the future of Roe, I wrote to @SecMayorkas re: the increasing threat posed by domestic violent extremists. \n\nTonight, I\u2019m voting to bolster security for SCOTUS justices and their families. \n\nHealthcare providers and patients deserve to be safe, too.",
