                "text": "Thanks to the American Rescue Plan, 6,000 people in our district were able to enroll in high-quality, affordable health coverage! \n\nThis is incredible progress, and I will continue to fight for lower healthcare costs for all Rhode Island families. https://t.co/7l9H0r6t0J",
