                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m always glad to see my friends from RI Developmental Disabilities Council.\n\nThank you to Kevin, Mike, and Chris for sharing insight on how we can strengthen Medicaid, and home- and community-based services, and economic opportunities for people with developmental disabilities. https://t.co/SDb9Vvv5tf",
