                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The science is indisputable \u2014 access to contraception is basic healthcare.\n\nMillions of women use birth control to make decisions about their bodies, lives, and futures.\n\nToday, I voted for the #RightToContraception Act to ensure the Supreme Court can't ever take that right away.",
