                "text": "The American Rescue Plan changed the course of the COVID crisis, created millions of jobs, lowered healthcare costs, helped reopen schools, and offered a little extra breathing room for Rhode Island families. \n\nToday, we're celebrating #500DaysofARP \ud83c\udf89 https://t.co/Cxg8ByjnC7",
