                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was great to meet with Dr. Amin and the rest of the staff at @RIHospital\u2019s pathology lab. \n\nOur healthcare infrastructure has never been so important, and I\u2019m so grateful for the work the pathology team is doing every day to keep Rhode Islanders safe and healthy. https://t.co/2r0zG5gyRd",
