                "text": "The American Rescue Plan made health insurance affordable for millions of uninsured Americans.\n\nThe #InflationReductionAct builds on that progress by lowering health care costs and prescription drug prices for Rhode Island families.\n\nHealth care must be accessible to everyone.",
